  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Thesauros is a yield optimization protocol that aggregates and rebalances deposits across multiple lending protocols (Aave V3, Compound V3, Morpho, Dolomite) to maximize user returns. It uses provider contracts to interface with each lending platform and rebalancer contracts to shift funds between them based on yield opportunities.",
    "relationship_narrative": "All contracts belong to a single product family where rebalancer contracts orchestrate fund movements between provider contracts. The providers act as adapters to external lending protocols, sharing a common interface for the rebalancer to deposit and withdraw funds.",
